+                    // outright rather than filtering entity URLs. SUPPORT_DTD=false is
+                    // the primary control: it rejects any DOCTYPE, closing external
+                    // file/SSRF entities AND internal entity-expansion (billion laughs)
+                    // in one move. IS_SUPPORTING_EXTERNAL_ENTITIES=false is
+                    // defense-in-depth for providers that still process a DTD subset.
+                    // The factory is fully configured locally and published to the
+                    // shared field only after configuration succeeds, so no unhardened
+                    // instance is ever cached. Any setProperty failure propagates via
+                    // the enclosing catch (rethrown as SOAPException) - never swallowed.
+                    XMLInputFactory factory = XMLInputFactory.newInstance();
+                    factory.setProperty(XMLInputFactory.SUPPORT_DTD, false);
+                    factory.setProperty(XMLInputFactory.IS_SUPPORTING_EXTERNAL_ENTITIES, false);
