+                    + "on a reused factory", attackText.contains(marker));
+        } catch (SOAPException expected) {
+            // DOCTYPE refused -> also acceptable.
+        }
+
+        // The same cached factory must still parse legitimate input after the attack.
+        String legit2 =
+            "<S:Envelope xmlns:S=\"" + SOAP_NS + "\">"
+          + "<S:Body><ns1:x xmlns:ns1=\"urn:x\">AFTER_ATTACK</ns1:x></S:Body></S:Envelope>";
+        assertTrue("legitimate parse after attack must still succeed on the reused factory",
+                materializeBodyText(lazyPlainMessage(legit2)).contains("AFTER_ATTACK"));
+    }
